# Omni - nvim (actions/nvim/nvim_omni.kbd)
**omni + spc**      -- Seek And Select
**omni + a**        -- Select All
**omni + b**        -- Pgup
**omni + c**        -- Copy
**omni + d**        -- Duplicate
**omni + f**        -- Pgdn
**omni + h**        -- H
**omni + j**        -- J
**omni + k**        -- K
**omni + l**        -- L
**omni + n**        -- New
**omni + lsft + n** -- New Folder
**omni + o**        -- Tag Follow
**omni + p**        -- Tag Back
**omni + q**        -- Quit
**omni + r**        -- Rename
**omni + s**        -- Sort
**omni + lsft + s** -- Sort Reverse
**omni + t**        -- New Tab
**omni + lsft + t** -- Undo Tab
**omni + u**        -- Remove Duplicates
**omni + v**        -- Paste
**omni + w**        -- Close Tab
**omni + x**        -- Cut
**omni + y**        -- Mody Mod;
**omni + z**        -- Undo
**omni + lsft + z** -- Redo
**omni + 1**        -- Tab 1
**omni + 2**        -- Tab 2
**omni + 3**        -- Tab 3
**omni + 4**        -- Tab 4
**omni + 5**        -- Tab 5
**omni + 6**        -- Tab 6
**omni + 7**        -- Tab 7
**omni + 8**        -- Tab 8
**omni + 9**        -- Tab 9
**omni + ]**        -- Forward
**omni + [**        -- Back
**omni + \**        -- Compare Toggle
**omni + ;**        -- Comment
**omni + ,**        -- Mod, Mod,
**omni + .**        -- Mod. Mod.
**omni + /**        -- Mod/ Mod/
